          "end": 943,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.350:block:1",
          "start": 455
        },
        "quote": "(b) It shall be the duty of each parking control officer or police officer to take the block number and the street name at which any vehicle is parked in violation of the provisions of this article and take the license tag number or any other available identification number of each such vehicle and issue a parking ticket or uniform citation, as the case may be. Each such officer shall leave on such vehicle a ticket or summons stating thereon the violation. (Ord. 20566 § 15, 6-10-25.)",
